const html: Record<string, string> = {"top":"<section class=\"gx gx-marquee\" aria-label=\"Built for\"><p class=\"gx-eyebrow\">Built for the people who decide what happens to a return</p><div class=\"gx-marquee-mask\"><ul class=\"gx-track\"><li>Returns managers</li><li>Warehouse leads</li><li>Inspectors</li><li>E-commerce retailers</li><li>3PLs</li><li>Fulfilment centres</li><li>Refurbishers</li><li>Resale teams</li><li>Fashion</li><li>Electronics</li><li>Home goods</li><li>Marketplaces</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">Returns managers</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">Warehouse leads</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">Inspectors</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">E-commerce retailers</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">3PLs</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">Fulfilment centres</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">Refurbishers</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">Resale teams</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">Fashion</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">Electronics</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">Home goods</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">Marketplaces</li></ul></div></section>\n<section id=\"problem\" class=\"gx gx-section\"><div class=\"gx-wrap\"><div><p class=\"gx-eyebrow\">The problem</p><h2 class=\"gx-h2\">Returns are a $890B problem — and most are processed by guesswork.</h2><p class=\"gx-intro\">Every return needs a reason, a condition grade and a destination: restock, repair, resale, recycle or inspect. Without consistent decisions, recoverable value ends up in a liquidation pallet.</p></div><div class=\"gx-grid gx-g3\"><figure class=\"gx-card gx-fig gx-reveal gx-lift gx-spot gx-d0\"><div class=\"gx-stat-v\"><small>$</small><b class=\"gx-b\" data-count=\"890\" data-dec=\"0\">890</b><span>B</span></div><figcaption><p>of merchandise US retailers expected to be returned in 2024.</p><a class=\"gx-src\" href=\"https://nrf.com/media-center/press-releases/nrf-and-happy-returns-report-2024-retail-returns-total-890-billion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Source: NRF &amp; Happy Returns, 2024 Consumer Returns in the Retail Industry ↗</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gx-card gx-fig gx-reveal gx-lift gx-spot gx-d2\"><div class=\"gx-stat-v\"><b class=\"gx-b\" data-count=\"16.9\" data-dec=\"1\">16.9</b><span>%</span></div><figcaption><p>of annual retail sales were expected to come back as returns in 2024, up from 14.5% in 2023.</p><a class=\"gx-src\" href=\"https://nrf.com/research/2024-consumer-returns-retail-industry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Source: NRF &amp; Happy Returns, 2024 Consumer Returns in the Retail Industry ↗</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"gx-card gx-fig gx-reveal gx-lift gx-spot gx-d4\"><div class=\"gx-stat-v\"><small>$</small><b class=\"gx-b\" data-count=\"247\" data-dec=\"0\">247</b><span>B</span></div><figcaption><p>of online purchases alone were expected to be returned — a 17.6% online return rate.</p><a class=\"gx-src\" href=\"https://nrf.com/research/2024-consumer-returns-retail-industry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Source: NRF &amp; Happy Returns, 2024 Consumer Returns in the Retail Industry ↗</a></figcaption></figure></div><p class=\"gx-small\">Published figures from the NRF, linked above. They describe the scale of retail returns, not ReturnRoute results.</p></div></section>\n<section id=\"solution\" class=\"gx gx-section gx-tint\"><div class=\"gx-wrap\"><div><p class=\"gx-eyebrow\">What we solve</p><h2 class=\"gx-h2\">From the returns pile to a consistent, approved decision for every item.</h2></div><div class=\"gx-grid gx-g2\"><div class=\"gx-card gx-reveal\"><p class=\"gx-eyebrow gx-eyebrow-muted\">Today</p><ul class=\"gx-list\"><li><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Return reasons are free text nobody analyses.</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Condition grades depend on who’s on shift.</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Recoverable items end up liquidated by default.</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Refund and disposal decisions aren’t recorded consistently.</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Nobody can see which products come back, and why.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"gx-card gx-with gx-reveal gx-spot gx-d2\"><p class=\"gx-eyebrow\">With ReturnRoute</p><ul class=\"gx-list\"><li><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span><span>Return reasons classified consistently from customer comments.</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span><span>Condition grades suggested from inspection notes and photos.</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span><span>Restock, repair, resale, recycle or inspect — recommended within your rules.</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span><span>Every consequential action approved by a person and audited.</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span><span>Return analytics by product, reason and channel.</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section>","mid":"<section id=\"compare\" class=\"gx gx-section\"><div class=\"gx-wrap\"><div><p class=\"gx-eyebrow\">Why ReturnRoute</p><h2 class=\"gx-h2\">How it compares with the way returns are processed today</h2><p class=\"gx-intro\">ReturnRoute works alongside your WMS and order system — it makes every inspection decision consistent and recorded.</p></div><div class=\"gx-table-wrap gx-reveal\"><table class=\"gx-table\"><thead><tr><th><span class=\"gx-sr\">Capability</span></th><th>Paper &amp; spreadsheets</th><th>WMS returns module</th><th>Returns portals</th><th class=\"gx-us\">ReturnRoute</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Classifies return reasons</th><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span> Free text</span></td><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span> Codes</span></td><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span> Customer picks</span></td><td class=\"gx-us\"><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span> From comments, with confidence</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Suggests condition grades</th><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span> Varies by inspector</span></td><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span> —</span></td><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span> —</span></td><td class=\"gx-us\"><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span> From notes and photos</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Recommends a recovery path</th><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span> Habit</span></td><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span> Fixed rules</span></td><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span> —</span></td><td class=\"gx-us\"><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span> Within your rules</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Human approval on consequential actions</th><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span> Informal</span></td><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span> Varies</span></td><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span> Auto-refunds</span></td><td class=\"gx-us\"><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span> Always, audited</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Return analytics by product and reason</th><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span> —</span></td><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span> Counts</span></td><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span> Portal data</span></td><td class=\"gx-us\"><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span> Linked to inspections</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Authorises refunds or disposal by itself</th><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span> —</span></td><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span> Some rules</span></td><td><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span> Some do</span></td><td class=\"gx-us\"><span class=\"gx-cell\"><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span> By design — never</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"ai\" class=\"gx gx-section gx-tint\"><div class=\"gx-wrap gx-split gx-even\"><div><div><p class=\"gx-eyebrow\">AI, used carefully</p><h2 class=\"gx-h2\">AI suggests. Your rules decide what’s permitted. Your staff approve.</h2><p class=\"gx-intro\">ReturnRoute’s AI classifies reasons and suggests grades and routes. Every refund, disposal or inventory change needs a person.</p></div><ul class=\"gx-list\"><li class=\"gx-card gx-li-card gx-reveal gx-lift gx-d0\"><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span><span>Classify a return reason from the customer’s comment</span></li><li class=\"gx-card gx-li-card gx-reveal gx-lift gx-d1\"><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span><span>Suggest a condition grade from inspection notes</span></li><li class=\"gx-card gx-li-card gx-reveal gx-lift gx-d2\"><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span><span>Recommend the highest-value permitted route</span></li><li class=\"gx-card gx-li-card gx-reveal gx-lift gx-d3\"><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span><span>Explain the evidence behind every suggestion</span></li><li class=\"gx-card gx-li-card gx-reveal gx-lift gx-d4\"><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span><span>Authorise a refund or dispose of a product</span></li><li class=\"gx-card gx-li-card gx-reveal gx-lift gx-d5\"><span class=\"gx-ic no\" aria-label=\"No\">✕</span><span>Adjust inventory without a person approving</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"gx-card gx-chat gx-reveal gx-d2\"><div class=\"gx-chat-head\">Returns assistant <span class=\"gx-badge\">Sample data</span></div><p class=\"gx-bubble-q\">Where should RMA-20418 go?</p><div class=\"gx-bubble-a\">Customer says “wrong size”. Inspection notes: tags attached, no wear, original packaging. Suggested grade A — restock is permitted for this category. Awaiting inspector approval.<em>From the RMA comment, inspection notes and category rules</em></div><p class=\"gx-bubble-q\">Refund them now.</p><div class=\"gx-bubble-a gx-muted\">I can’t authorise refunds. Once the inspector approves grade A, the refund request goes to your finance queue.</div><a class=\"gx-btn gx-mt\" href=\"/#demo\">Try it in the live demo →</a></div></div></section>","end":"<section id=\"team\" class=\"gx gx-section gx-tint\"><div class=\"gx-wrap\"><div><p class=\"gx-eyebrow\">Team</p><h2 class=\"gx-h2\">The people building ReturnRoute</h2><p class=\"gx-intro\">Founded by Kelechi Obi (Founder/CEO) and Halima Bello (Co-founder/CTO), and built together with the teams who will use it.</p></div><div class=\"gx-mt44\"><div class=\"gx gx-grid gx-g2 gx-mt0\"><article class=\"gx-card gx-reveal gx-lift gx-spot gx-d0\"><div class=\"gx-person\"><div class=\"gx-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b>KO</b></div><div class=\"gx-min0\"><p class=\"gx-role\">Founder/CEO</p><h3>Kelechi Obi</h3><p>Kelechi founded ReturnRoute so every return reaches its highest-value recovery path — and leads product, retailers and every pilot.</p><ul class=\"gx-tags\" aria-label=\"Focus areas\"><li>Product</li><li>Retailers</li><li>Pilots</li></ul></div></div></article><article class=\"gx-card gx-reveal gx-lift gx-spot gx-d2\"><div class=\"gx-person\"><div class=\"gx-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><b>HB</b></div><div class=\"gx-min0\"><p class=\"gx-role\">Co-founder/CTO</p><h3>Halima Bello</h3><p>Halima co-founded ReturnRoute and leads its technology — from reason classification and condition grading to the cloud platform behind it.</p><ul class=\"gx-tags\" aria-label=\"Focus areas\"><li>Classification</li><li>Inspection AI</li><li>Cloud platform</li></ul></div></div></article></div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"roadmap\" class=\"gx gx-section\"><div class=\"gx-wrap\"><div><p class=\"gx-eyebrow\">Roadmap</p><h2 class=\"gx-h2\">Where ReturnRoute is going</h2><p class=\"gx-intro\">Built with early-access customers. The order below is our plan and may change based on what pilots teach us.</p></div><ol class=\"gx-grid gx-g4 gx-ol\"><li class=\"gx-card gx-reveal gx-lift gx-now gx-d0\"><div class=\"gx-stage\"><span><i class=\"gx-live\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Now</span></div><h3>Live demo &amp; early access</h3><ul class=\"gx-list gx-list-sm\"><li><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Routing demo and dashboard on fictional returns</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Reason classification and condition grading</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Approvals and audit trail</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic ok\" aria-label=\"Yes\">✓</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Demo requests open</span></li></ul></li><li class=\"gx-card gx-reveal gx-lift gx-d2\"><div class=\"gx-stage\"><span>Next</span></div><h3>Pilot with one warehouse</h3><ul class=\"gx-list gx-list-sm\"><li><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Your categories and routing rules</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Photo-assisted grading with Amazon Bedrock</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">WMS export of decisions</span></li></ul></li><li class=\"gx-card gx-reveal gx-lift gx-d3\"><div class=\"gx-stage\"><span>Then</span></div><h3>General availability</h3><ul class=\"gx-list gx-list-sm\"><li><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Order-system and WMS integrations</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">SSO with roles enforced on the server</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Resale-channel listings</span></li></ul></li><li class=\"gx-card gx-reveal gx-lift gx-d5\"><div class=\"gx-stage\"><span>Later</span></div><h3>Exploring with pilots</h3><ul class=\"gx-list gx-list-sm\"><li><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Supplier return-to-vendor packs</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Product-quality alerts</span></li><li><span class=\"gx-ic part\" aria-label=\"Partly\">–</span><span class=\"gx-muted\">Recovery value forecasting</span></li></ul></li></ol></div></section>\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"gx gx-section\"><div class=\"gx-wrap gx-split\"><div><div><p class=\"gx-eyebrow\">FAQ</p><h2 class=\"gx-h2\">Questions returns teams ask</h2></div><a class=\"gx-link\" href=\"mailto:hello@returnroute.site\">✉ Email the founders</a></div><div class=\"gx-faq gx-reveal\"><details><summary>Does ReturnRoute authorise refunds or disposal?</summary><p>No. AI outputs are advisory. Every refund, disposal or inventory adjustment needs a person’s approval, and every decision is audited.</p></details><details><summary>What problem does it actually solve?</summary><p>Return decisions vary by shift and recoverable value is lost. ReturnRoute classifies reasons, suggests condition grades and recommends the highest-value route your rules permit — for a person to approve.</p></details><details><summary>Does it replace our WMS?</summary><p>No. It works alongside it; warehouse integration is simulated in the demo and scoped per pilot.</p></details><details><summary>How are grades suggested?</summary><p>From inspection notes and photos, with the evidence shown. Inspectors confirm or change every grade.</p></details><details><summary>How much does it cost?</summary><p>See the pricing page. Prices are illustrative and exclude taxes.</p></details><details><summary>Is it available today?</summary><p>ReturnRoute is in early access. The demo runs on fictional returns; a pilot runs in one of your warehouses. Request a demo and a founder will reply personally.</p></details></div></div></section>","privacy":"<section class=\"gx gx-section gx-legal\"><div class=\"gx-wrap\"><p class=\"gx-eyebrow\">Review draft · operator details to be confirmed</p><h1 class=\"gx-h2\">Privacy notice</h1><h2>What this website is</h2><p>This website describes ReturnRoute and includes an interactive demo that runs on sample data. No customer systems are connected.</p><h2>Demo data</h2><p>Changes you make in the demo are kept in your browser (local storage) or in the demo server’s memory and contain only sample data. Clearing site data removes them.</p><h2>Early-access requests</h2><p>When the request form is connected to a customer-relationship service (proposed: HubSpot), submitting it sends the fields you enter, your consent choices and the page address to that service so ReturnRoute can reply. Product updates are sent only if you opt in. Until then, requests are kept in your browser and you are offered a pre-filled email to hello@returnroute.site.</p><h2>Analytics and cookies</h2><p>This website includes no advertising trackers. A hosting provider may process routine request data to serve and protect the site.</p><h2>Your requests</h2><p>Contact hello@returnroute.site with questions about information you have sent to ReturnRoute, or to ask for it to be corrected or deleted.</p><p class=\"gx-small gx-mt34\">Contact: <a href=\"mailto:hello@returnroute.site\">hello@returnroute.site</a></p></div></section>","terms":"<section class=\"gx gx-section gx-legal\"><div class=\"gx-wrap\"><p class=\"gx-eyebrow\">Review draft · operator details to be confirmed</p><h1 class=\"gx-h2\">Terms of use</h1><h2>Demonstration only</h2><p>The demo runs on sample data. It is not a production system and must not be used for real returns decisions.</p><h2>People decide</h2><p>ReturnRoute organises information and flags items for review. Decisions stay with qualified people on your team.</p><h2>Pricing and availability</h2><p>Prices shown are illustrative and exclude taxes. Early-access requests do not create a subscription or any commitment.</p><h2>Use of the site</h2><p>Use the site and demo lawfully. Do not upload personal or confidential information to the demo.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>These terms are a review draft. Operator details, governing law and service terms will be set out before launch.</p><p class=\"gx-small gx-mt34\">Contact: <a href=\"mailto:hello@returnroute.site\">hello@returnroute.site</a></p></div></section>"};

